    "一次购买，不自动续费。存钱记录、日历、累计和第一个目标的转盘永久免费。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次购买，不自动续费。存钱记录、日历、累计和第一个目标的转盘永久免费。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One purchase, no renewal. Records, calendar, totals, and your first goal's wheel stay free forever."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次購買，不自動續費。存錢記錄、日曆、累計和第一個目標的轉盤永久免費。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
